1
00:00:00,416 --> 00:00:05,369
Make the bar yours. Presets, size,
shape, colour and where it sits.

2
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:10,505
Open Appearance.
In Gesture Volume, tap Appearance.

3
00:00:10,545 --> 00:00:13,483
The preview at the top
shows the bar on a phone.

4
00:00:13,817 --> 00:00:17,477
Start from a preset.
Quick presets set the whole look at once:

5
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:20,440
Classic, Dock, Edge and Bold.

6
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:27,227
Size and shape. Open Size &
shape and drag Width and Height.

7
00:00:27,267 --> 00:00:30,129
Rounded or Tab sets how the ends look.

8
00:00:31,592 --> 00:00:35,157
Pick a colour. Under Colours,
tap Fill and choose a colour.

9
00:00:35,197 --> 00:00:37,504
The preview takes it straight away.

10
00:00:41,017 --> 00:00:45,032
Choose a side. Under Position,
put it on the left or the right,

11
00:00:45,072 --> 00:00:47,705
and set how far down the edge it sits.

12
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:50,912
Save it. Tap Save.

13
00:00:50,952 --> 00:00:54,508
Go home, and your bar is
on the edge just as you made it.

14
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:00,368
Up next: Keep it out of the way.
